## Program Learning Outcomes

Students completing this program will be able to:

- Demonstrate comprehensive knowledge of biblical and theological studies.
- Interpret Scripture using sound hermeneutical principles.
- Understand Christian doctrines from a Pentecostal–Charismatic perspective.
- Explain the baptism, gifts, and ministry of the Holy Spirit.
- Develop biblical preaching, teaching, and ministry skills.
- Apply Christian leadership principles to church and ministry settings.
- Demonstrate spiritual maturity and ethical Christian leadership.
